flowchart TB
 A[Failure detected] --> B{Where?}
 B -->|Inventory DB| C[Fail closed; same-key retry after fenced recovery]
 B -->|Gateway timeout| D[UNKNOWN payment; retain stock; lookup intent]
 B -->|Broker unavailable| E[Retain local outbox; throttle backlog]
 B -->|Order unavailable| F[Retain committed event; replay]
 B -->|Poison event| G[DLQ + alert + repair + same-ID replay]
 D --> H{Definitive outcome?}
 H -->|Success| I[SOLD then order]
 H -->|Non-chargeable failure| J[Release hold once]
 H -->|Unknown| K[Keep hold; escalate15m]
